      "title": "Private Pools",
      "summary": "Design guidance for private swimming pools covers siting, size, shape, construction types, water cleaning, filtration, heating, child protection, and frost protection. Pools should be protected from wind, visible from the house, and kept clear of deciduous planting. Simple rectangular shapes are recommended; recirculation is usual, and pool heating can extend the swimming season.",
